<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SEEFF IN TALKS, ISSUES CAUTIONARY.</title>
<headline>SEEFF IN TALKS, ISSUES CAUTIONARY.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seeff Holdings Ltd advised on Wednesday that negotiations were in progress which, if successfully concluded, may effect its share price.</p>
<p>Seeff urged shareholdes to exercise caution when dealing in their shares until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
